1. Project setup
Sabse pehle humne Playwright project create kiya.

Command:
npm init playwright@latest


Isse project mein Playwright install hua aur initial files create hui.

Important commands:
npm install
npx playwright test
npx playwright show-report


- npm install – dependencies install karta hai.
- npx playwright test – tests run karta hai.
- npx playwright show-report – HTML report open karta hai.
