11. Environment Configuration
File: config/envConfig.js

Humne 3 environments configure kiye:
- Dev
- QA
- Prod
Basic structure:
const environments = {
  dev: {
    baseURL: 'https://www.saucedemo.com/',
    apiBaseURL: 'https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com',
  },

  qa: {
    baseURL: 'https://www.saucedemo.com/',
    apiBaseURL: 'https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com',
  },

  prod: {
    baseURL: 'https://www.saucedemo.com/',
    apiBaseURL: 'https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com',
  },
};

const environmentName = process.env.TEST_ENV || 'qa';

if (!environments[environmentName]) {
  throw new Error(
    `Invalid TEST_ENV: ${environmentName}. Use dev, qa, or prod.`
  );
}

export const envConfig = environments[environmentName];


Environment kaise select karte hain?

PowerShell:
$env:TEST_ENV="dev"


$env:TEST_ENV="qa"


$env:TEST_ENV="prod"


Environment configuration check karne ke liye:
node --input-type=module -e "import { envConfig } from './config/envConfig.js'; console.log(envConfig)"


Humne teeno environments par configuration load karke verify ki.

Important: Abhi teeno URLs same hain. Real office project mein alag Dev, QA aur Production URLs configure karenge.
12. Git and GitHub
Humne project ke andar independent Git repository initialize ki.

Important commands:
Command	Purpose
git init	Git repository create
git status	Changes check
git add .	Changes stage
git commit -m "message"	Local history mein save
git push	GitHub par upload
git pull	Remote changes download
git remote -v	Remote URL check
git log --oneline	Commit history check

GitHub repository:
OfficeAutomationFramework – GitHubHumne .gitignore mein ye folders exclude kiye:
node_modules/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
playwright/.cache/
playwright/.auth/


Git Commit aur Git Tag ka difference:
- Commit: Changes ka snapshot save karta hai.
- Tag: Important version ko naam deta hai, jaise v1.0.0.
LF/CRLF warning bhi dekhi thi. Woh Windows aur Unix line endings ka difference hai, koi fatal error nahi.

